llm_calls.content:
{
  "selected_feature_id": 4,
  "rationale": "Visibility is a direct, semantically causal indicator of driving hazard severity that should transfer across domains better than calendar/time variables or location-proxy road features. It adds complementary weather risk information beyond Weather_Condition while avoiding stronger domain-shift and shortcut concerns from Year, Month, Hour, or sparse infrastructure indicators."
}

